WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Your friend: Alibi is a party game about your friends.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Your friend: Join on your phone. Everyone shares one screen.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Cowboy: Pick your character. Make yourself at home.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Flower: One friend answers a question. Everyone else writes a lie.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Frog: Now vote: which answer is actually true?

00:30.000 --> 00:35.000
Cowboy: Find the truth for points. Fool friends for more.

00:35.000 --> 00:41.000
Cape: Round two: write questions about each other.

00:41.000 --> 00:46.000
Flower: Secret roles give you a little help.

00:46.000 --> 00:52.000
Cowboy: Final round: I answer a question, then sit out.

00:52.000 --> 00:58.000
Cape: I see Cowboy’s answer. The other artists only see the question.

00:58.000 --> 01:04.000
Flower: Time to draw. You get 90 seconds.

01:04.000 --> 01:10.000
Frog: Which drawing came from the artist who knew?

01:10.000 --> 01:15.000
Cape: Timers, scores, and reconnecting? All handled.

01:15.000 --> 01:20.000
Flower: Most points wins. Think you know your friends?
